# Local documentation

`docs/` and any nested `docs/` directory are gitignored so briefs, proposals, and decks are not published.

Git ignore does not hide those files from this workspace.

- Read files under `docs/` when the task needs them, including `tanaad-app/docs/`.
- When the user attaches a file from `docs/`, treat that attachment as a normal source.
- Do not skip a docs file because it is gitignored.
- Do not stage or commit anything under `docs/`.
